Build with

```text
lake build AxiomAudit
```

Every `#assert_axioms` below fails elaboration if its declaration depends on any axiom other
than the standard classical principles `propext`, `Classical.choice`, and `Quot.sound`.  The
audit is therefore an enforced regression test rather than output a human must read: an
introduced `sorry`, project axiom, or `native_decide` anywhere in an audited dependency cone
breaks this target's build.

Deliberate omissions:

- the generated exact certificate tables are audited by the separate opt-in
  `AxiomAuditCertificate` target, keeping this audit independent of that roughly five-minute
  build.
-/

